{
  "$comment": "Default settings of new operations, for every user of the site. Edit this file on the server, no new build needed; reload the page to see the change. A setting missing or invalid keeps the value built into pcbCAM (the browser console says which). Depths, layers and tools are always chosen from the board. See docs/architecture.md section 23.",
  "isolation": {
    "$comment": "passes: 1 to 20; overlap: 0 to 0.9 (share of the cutting width); direction: climb or conventional; combinePasses: true or false; extraOffset: mm, 0 to 5",
